# libuuid / util-linux vulnerabilities
# Justification: These vulnerabilities relate to the 'mount' and 'nsenter' commands (SUID mount, post-mount hooks, cgroup migrations).
# Our FastAPI application runs in an unprivileged container and does not perform any filesystem mounting or namespace migrations,
# making these CVEs not exploitable in this context.
